              "_type": "span",
              "text": "20.1 Modifications\r\nWe reserve the right to update or modify this Privacy Policy at any time. When We make material changes, We will:\r\n- Update the \"Last Updated\" date at the top of this Policy\r\n- Notify Users via email and/or in-app notification about significant changes\r\n- Provide a summary of key changes\r\n- Post the revised Policy on the Platform\r\n\r\n### 20.2 Continued Use\r\nYour continued use of the Platform after any changes to this Privacy Policy constitutes Your acceptance of the updated Policy. If You do not agree with the changes, You should discontinue use of the Platform and request deletion of Your data.\r\n\r\n### 20.3 Version History\r\nWe maintain a version history of this Privacy Policy. Previous versions may be requested by contacting Us at the email address provided below.\r\n\r\n---",
