              "text": "Your privacy is important to Us. Our collection, use, storage, and sharing of Your personal information is governed by Our [Privacy Policy](https://classgrid.in/legal/privacy-policy), which is incorporated into these Terms by reference.\r\n\r\nBy using the Platform, You acknowledge that You have read and understood Our Privacy Policy.",
